3 Section in inc2_c
═══════════════════

  This will be a true level 1 section.  Even though this got included by
  another include file who's level one sections were actually at level
  3, the `:minlevel 1' directive provides an *absolute* section level,
  not a relative one.

  But, not all is as it seems!  When this file is done, the file that
  included it has another section (level 2 in that file, which is level
  4 overall), and… it is at *level 4*, although the section numbering
  puts it as a 4th level subsection underneath this level 1 primary
  section!


◊ 3.0.0.1 S1.2

  And back up to the include levels here.

  Third include file here


